harge you, create a subscription or verify payment. No artificial deadline/countdown is used.</p><p className="rounded-xl border border-slate-800 p-4">{TEAM_SERVICE_SCOPE} Lifetime includes the same service access. Forecasts are planning estimates, not guaranteed sales, profit or rankings.</p></div></section>;
